{"id":"agente","lemma":"agente","pos":"noun","rank":449,"glosses":["agent","police officer, policeman, policewoman"],"ipa":"/aˈxente/","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"agentes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-agente.wav","formAudio":{"agentes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-agentes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom es un agente inmobiliario.","en":"Tom is a realtor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798410"},{"text":"Somos agentes del FBI.","en":"We're FBI agents."},{"text":"Él es un agente del FBI.","en":"He is an FBI agent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819918"},{"text":"La compañía ha enviado varios agentes para tratar el asunto.","en":"The company has sent several representatives to discuss the matter."},{"text":"Tom es el agente de Mary.","en":"Tom is Mary's agent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/303550"}]}